    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a new [binding deployment requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for the Meridian project, mandating that all releases carry a signed manifest. This directive is framed as a [direct response to past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), specifically citing the unauthorized arrival of unsigned artifacts in staging. The implementation is [strictly defined](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), with the scope [explicitly extended to both staging and production environments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4). Fairweather has [formally assumed ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of this gate, shifting from a technical justification to a position of direct administrative authority.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The justification shifts from a technical security concern to a personal exercise of administrative authority." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "The voice oscillates between formal, rule-based pronouncements and plain-spoken, grievance-driven justification." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "power" ; narr:reading "Authority is asserted through both the legitimacy of the role and the rationalization of past failures." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "value" ; narr:reading "The focus is heavily weighted toward conservation and risk mitigation, with a secondary pivot toward self-assertion." ; narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
